          tryIt: "Atisaye kawai, da lambobin ƙirƙira. Sam ya yi aiki sa'o'i 20, an biya shi albashin hannu na $2.13 kuma ya samu $70 a tukwici. Ku yi lissafin: 20 x $7.25 = $145. Albashin hannu 20 x $2.13 = $42.60. $42.60 + $70 = $112.60. Shin hakan ya isa? Nawa mai ɗaukar aiki yake bin sa? (Amsa: $32.40.) Sannan ku nemi jiharku a shafin albashin tukwici na Department of Labor ku rubuta dokarta.",
          youCanNow: "duba cewa albashin tukwici na mako ya kai mafi ƙarancin albashi, gane al'adar tukwici da ta saɓa wa doka, da riƙe bayanin tukwicinku a rubuce.",
