            { objective: "O3", q: "Manajanku yana ɗaukar rabo daga tip pool kowane dare. Me ke gaskiya?", options: ["Wannan al'ada ce kuma ya halatta", "A ƙarshen mako kawai ya halatta", "Manajoji da masu kulawa ba za su iya ɗaukar tukwici daga tip pool ba", "Ya halatta idan manajan ma yana share teburi"], answer: 2, why: "FLSA ta hana manajoji da masu kulawa karɓar tukwici daga tip pool." }
